	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process. It starts with sending to the senior accountant in your department. 
When sending to the senior accountant in your department is completed, creating a receiving report needs to be done. 
When creating a receiving report is completed, you need to gather the vendors invoice.
When gathering the vendors invoice is completed, stamping all documents needs to be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process, which starts with sending to the senior accountant in your department.
When the sending to the senior accountant in your department is complete, a receipt report must be created.
When a receiving report is completed, you need to gather the vendor invoice.
After gathering the vendor invoice is completed, all documents should be stamped.
The process is now completed.
"
